.env
.env.*
.neon
**/secrets.json
**/appsettings.Development.json
**/appsettings.Local.json
**/arduino_secrets.h

# Not part of the image
.git/
.github/
.vs/
.vscode/
Arduino/
docs/
**/node_modules/
**/*.Tests/
*.md
